 "notes": [
  "Converted from the preset: each pad's sample parts for its note, Key Zone Shift and Sample Selector as stored; velocity zones become layers, a crossfade a switch where a part falls below half its level (a fade at the velocity range's edge keeps playing). gainDb = pad and chain faders + Simpler volume + part volume; Vel as law 'simpler'.",
  "Not reproduced: the instruments' envelopes (every sample plays its region to the end), filters (only their drive), the pads' other devices (none) and the devices around the Drum Rack (none)."
